# Testing and evidence

Never claim a test, build, lint, migration, deployment, or runtime check passed unless the command actually ran and its result was observed.

Return:
- exact command;
- exit status;
- important output;
- files/artifacts produced;
- hashes when required;
- skipped checks and why.

A green local test does not equal BUILD PASS.
